---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Kontak" description="Cara menghubungi saya.">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 pt-12 pb-16">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-2 text-ink">Kontak</h1>
    <div class="max-w-xl">
      <p class="text-muted mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Ada pertanyaan, ide kolaborasi, atau sekadar mau menyapa? Isi formulir di bawah,
        atau kirim email langsung ke
        <a href="mailto:septa.aji.sisworo@gmail.com" class="text-orange hover:underline underline-offset-2">septa.aji.sisworo@gmail.com</a>.
      </p>

      <form
        name="kontak"
        method="POST"
        data-netlify="true"
        netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
        class="space-y-5"
      >
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="kontak" />
        <p class="hidden">
          <label>Jangan isi ini kalau kamu manusia: <input name="bot-field" /></label>
        </p>

        <div>
          <label for="nama" class="block text-sm mb-1.5">Nama</label>
          <input
            type="text"
            id="nama"
            name="nama"
            required
            class="w-full border border-line rounded-sm px-4 py-2.5 bg-surface text-ink placeholder:text-muted/50 focus:border-orange outline-none"
          />
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="email" class="block text-sm mb-1.5">Email</label>
          <input
            type="email"
            id="email"
            name="email"
            required
            class="w-full border border-line rounded-sm px-4 py-2.5 bg-surface text-ink placeholder:text-muted/50 focus:border-orange outline-none"
          />
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="pesan" class="block text-sm mb-1.5">Pesan</label>
          <textarea
            id="pesan"
            name="pesan"
            rows="5"
            required
            class="w-full border border-line rounded-sm px-4 py-2.5 bg-surface text-ink placeholder:text-muted/50 focus:border-orange outline-none"
          ></textarea>
        </div>

        <button
          type="submit"
          class="bg-orange text-navy font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-sm text-sm hover:bg-orangeLight hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all"
        >
          Kirim pesan
        </button>
      </form>

      <p class="text-xs text-muted/70 mt-6">
        Formulir ini pakai Netlify Forms — otomatis aktif kalau situs kamu di-deploy ke Netlify,
        tanpa perlu backend tambahan. Kalau kamu deploy ke Vercel/GitHub Pages, ganti dengan
        layanan seperti Formspree (lihat README).
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
